---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: investorPosition.vestingContract != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: no vesting contract
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_check_vesting --> q_calculate_vested: vesting contract exists
    q_calculate_vested --> q_check_releasable: compute releasableAmount from vesting schedule
    q_check_releasable --> q_release: releasableAmount > 0
    q_check_releasable --> q_revert_nothing: releasableAmount == 0
    q_revert_nothing --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_release --> q_transfer: vestingContract.release()
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transfer vested askToken to investor
    q_emit --> [*]: emit VestedTokensReleased(investor, releasableAmount)

    note right of q_calculate_vested
        INV-001: Vested amount increases monotonically over time
        INV-002: Total released never exceeds total allocated
        INV-003: Only investors with vesting contracts can call
    end note
